From bebf04bbaa2430dd4e66c3d1c0f595a64fd911c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 15:49:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Point every buy link at the AFT Whop store

whop_store was still https://whop.com/goal33systems/ and no product carried a link to its page on
the AFT store, so every buy button on the site went to the old Whop.

- catalog2.json: each strategy's whop field set to its product on the AFT store (route
  aft-official), bundles.all_access.whop added, whop_store repointed.
- gen_pages.py: bundle_page takes an href, so the All-Access buy box links to the All-Access
  product rather than dropping the buyer on the store front.

The URLs are the ones the Whop API returned when the products were created - four do not follow
the slug (undertow -> the-press-aft, relay -> headline-risk-aft, meridian -> the-pendulum-aft,
closer -> counterweight-aft), so they cannot be derived from the catalog slug by rule.

Source only - run the three generators to rebuild the pages:
    python3 _tools/gen_pages.py && python3 _tools/rebuild_index.py && python3 _tools/gen_plan.py
---
